    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Spratt offer for sale this spacious beautifully presented four bedroom home, perfectly positioned overlooking a well maintained green area and benefiting from convenient adjacent car parking. Newly decorated throughout, this attractive property presents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser seeking a turnkey home. The property has the benefit of a private south-facing rear garden with a patio area providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing. Ideally located just off the N25 Waterford??Cork route, the home is within close proximity to major employers including Haleon, GSK, and Eurofins Lancaster Laboratories. Dungarvan Town Centre is within easy walking distance and offers a full range of amenities including schools, shops, cafs, restaurants, and pubs. Clonea Beach, the Waterford Greenway, along with numerous sporting and recreational facilities, are also easily accessible.. The bright spacious accommodation extends to approximately 124 sq. m. and is arranged over three floors. Ground Floor: Entrance Hallway, Guest WC, Living Room, Kitchen/Diner, Utility, First Floor: 2 Bedrooms, Bathroom, Second Floor Master Bedroom with Walk in Wardrobe and Ensuite. REA Spratt highly recommend viewing of this beautiful home. \n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\n5.75m x 0.89m Tiled floor, understairs storage, storage cupboard, Guest WC off.\n\nLiving Room\n4.40m x 3.71m Feature open fire, timber surround, marble hearth, aspect to front.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area\n3.66m x 3.47m Floor Eye level Units, timber flooring, tiled splashback, Electric Cooker, extractor, plumbed for dishwasher. patio doors to rear.\n\nUtility Room\n2.13m x 1.88m Tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine, dryer, door to rear\n\nFirst Floor\n Carpet\n\nBedroom 1\n3.86m x 3.08m Carpet\n\nBedroom 2\n2.95m x 2.62m Carpet\n\nBathroom\n2.04m x 1.67m Tiled shower surround and tiled floor, extractor.\n\nSecond Floor\n Hotpress off\n\nBedroom 3\n2.92m x 2.63m Carpet\n\nMaster Bedroom\n5.51m x 3.52m Bright spacious room, Ensuite off\n\nEn-suite\n2.62m x 0.95m Tiled floor, tiled shower cubicle, Mira Elite electric shower\n\n\nOutside\n-Enclosed south facing rear garden -Garden Shed -Gated side entrance"
      },
